    "Turning sharing off stops new reporting, cancels requests still in progress where possible and removes the identifier from Roam Control. It cannot withdraw anonymous events already received.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉分享會停止新的回報、盡可能取消仍在進行中的請求，並從 Roam Control 移除識別碼。但無法收回已經送達的匿名事件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
